      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were contacted out of the blue and although we had thought of getting a solar system we had not done our homework.  It all sounded reasonable and the salesperson seemed knowledgeable.  I then contacts Finn to see what other suppliers there were in our area and we had 2 new quotes done.  The one we selected showed superior knowledge and on the ground experience, backed up by a friend who has used this company and he is very happy with their service- so although they were a little more expensive- we selected them.The other two quotes missed an important element about our 2 phase electricity supply to the shed where we wanted to put the solar panels. This was important as we need 2 inverters.  This was only discovered because he was thorough and opened up our electricity box to investigate- neither of the previous quoters had bothered.  The thoroughness of this investigation and the information and contact provided since has been extremely good. I am very glad we bothered to get additional quotes.",
